<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PreCheckd - Become a Verified Recruiter</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #C8E6C9;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .signup-wrapper {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      background: #C8E6C9;
    }

    .signup-layout {
      max-width: 1600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .left-section {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      min-height: 500px;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #999;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .center-section {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .right-section {
      position: sticky;
      top: 2rem;
      height: fit-content;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .signup-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .signup-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: #2d4a52;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .signup-header p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .progress-section {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .progress-label {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      width: 100%;
      height: 6px;
      background: #e8e6e1;
      border-radius: 3px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: #2ecc71;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .form-section {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }

    .form-section.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2d4a52;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-description {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2d4a52;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .form-group input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .form-group input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #2ecc71;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.1);
    }

    .form-group input::placeholder {
      color: #999;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #2ecc71;
      color: white;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.875rem;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #27ae60;
    }

    .resend-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .resend-container p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .resend-link {
      color: #2ecc71;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .resend-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .success-message {
      background: #e8f5e9;
      border: 1px solid #c8e6c9;
      color: #2e7d32;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .legal-text {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #999;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .legal-text a {
      color: #2ecc71;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-text a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    #stripe-identity-container {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      min-height: 400px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: #fafaf8;
    }

    /* FAQ Styles */
    .faq-container {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .faq-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2d4a52;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .faq-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .faq-question {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      margin: -0.75rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .faq-question:hover {
      background: #f5f5f5;
    }

    .faq-question-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2d4a52;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .faq-caret {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #2ecc71;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }

    .faq-caret.open {
      transform: rotate(-180deg);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .faq-answer.open {
      max-height: 500px;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1400px) {
      .signup-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .left-section {
        display: none;
      }

      .right-section {
        position: static;
        max-height: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .signup-wrapper {
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .signup-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .center-section {
        padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      }

      .signup-header h1 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .left-section {
        display: flex;
      }

      .right-section {
        position: static;
        max-height: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="signup-wrapper">
  <div class="signup-layout">
    <!-- Left Section (Placeholder for future content) -->
    <div class="left-section">
      Coming soon: Video tutorials and testimonials
    </div>

    <!-- Center Section (Form) -->
    <div class="center-section">
      <div class="signup-header">
        <h1>Become a Verified Recruiter</h1>
        <p>Get verified, build trust with candidates. Verification is free for founding members and takes about 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-section">
        <div class="progress-label">
          <span id="progress-text">Step 1 of 3</span>
          <span id="progress-percent">33%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-bar">
          <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 1: Your Details -->
      <div class="form-section active" id="step-signup">
        <h2 class="section-title">Your Details</h2>
        <p class="section-description">We'll verify your identity and corporate email to create your verified profile.</p>

        <form id="signup-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="firstName">First name</label>
            <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="lastName">Last name</label>
            <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Corporate email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="phone">Phone number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 555-0123" required>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="company">Company</label>
            <input type="text" id="company" name="company">
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Continue</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: Verify Phone -->
      <div class="form-section" id="step-phone">
        <h2 class="section-title">Verify Your Phone</h2>
        <p class="section-description">We sent a 6-digit code to the phone number you provided. Enter it below.</p>

        <form id="phone-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="code">Verification code</label>
            <input type="text" id="code" name="code" placeholder="000000" maxlength="6" required>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Verify</button>

          <div class="resend-container">
            <p>Didn't receive a code?</p>
            <a href="#" id="resend-btn" class="resend-link">Send again</a>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: Identity Verification -->
      <div class="form-section" id="step-payment">
        <h2 class="section-title">Complete Your Verification</h2>
        <p class="section-description">Upload your government ID and take a selfie to complete identity verification.</p>

        <div id="stripe-identity-container"></div>

        <div id="success-message" class="success-message" style="display: none;">
          ✓ Identity verification submitted successfully! We'll review your information and activate your account within 24 hours.
        </div>

        <button id="verify-button" class="btn btn-primary">Start Verification</button>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-text">
        By signing up, you agree to our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> and <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Section (FAQ) -->
    <div class="right-section">
      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">How long does verification take?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Most verifications are completed within 24 hours. You'll receive an email confirmation once your profile is live and ready to use.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">What do I need to verify?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            You'll need a valid government ID (driver's license, passport, or national ID) and a recent photo. We use facial recognition to match your ID to ensure authenticity.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">Is there a cost to join?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Verification is completely free for founding members. No hidden fees, no subscriptions. You only pay when you start connecting with candidates.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">When can I access candidates?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Once your verification is complete and your profile is live, you'll immediately have access to our candidate network and can start posting jobs or connecting with candidates.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">How is my data protected?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            We use bank-level encryption and industry-standard security measures to protect your data. Your information is never shared without consent, and we comply with all data protection regulations.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="faq-question-text">Can I edit my profile after verification?</div>
            <div class="faq-caret">^</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes! Once your profile is live, you can update your bio, specialties, and other information anytime. Your verification badge stays intact as long as your information remains current.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/recruiter-signup.js"></script>
<script>
  function toggleFaq(element) {
    const answer = element.nextElementSibling;
    const caret = element.querySelector('.faq-caret');
    
    answer.classList.toggle('open');
    caret.classList.toggle('open');
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>